t;• PhotoProgress → EventBus&amp; : 조각 이벤트 발행&lt;br&gt;• BoardView, HudView, NextBlockView, PhotoFrameView → const StageSession&amp;  (읽기 전용)&lt;br&gt;• PhotoPainter : 상태 없는 도구 클래스 (static 오버로딩)&lt;br&gt;• BossGimmick, Pill → PlayContext&amp; : 매 호출 시 인자로 전달 (의존)&lt;br&gt;• SoundCueListener → ISoundPlayer&amp;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1045" y="313" width="560" height="192" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="④ 클래스 상세" id="p99575087"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="v2" value="&lt;b&gt;④ 클래스 상세&lt;/b&gt; — 패키지별 전체 멤버 (관계선은 ②·③ 탭에)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="&lt;b&gt;범례&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;+ public  - private  # protected&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;기울임&lt;/i&gt;: 순수 가상 함수 (= 0)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1a5fd0&quot;&gt;파란 글씨&lt;/font&gt;: 오버로딩&lt;br&gt;굵은 점선 테두리: 추상 클래스 / 인터페이스" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="0" width="330" height="107" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="flow/ — 게임 루프와 장면" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;opacity=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="60" width="1580" height="826" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Game&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- m_rng: std::mt19937&lt;br&gt;- m_console: Console&lt;br&gt;- m_input: IInputSource&amp;amp;&lt;b